=========================================================================
Third-Party Software, Core AI Engines, and Technology Acknowledgements
=========================================================================

PhoenixDub AI orchestrates, interfaces with, and builds upon the following
major open-source software packages, frameworks, neural architectures, and
generative tools:

1. MOTOR DE TRANSCRIÇÃO E ALINHAMENTO FONÉTICO
   - Faster-Whisper / OpenAI Whisper (MIT License)
     Efficient speech transcription using CTranslate2.
   - WhisperX (BSD-2-Clause License)
     Forced phoneme alignment and word-level timestamping.
   - Silero VAD (MIT License)
     Voice activity detection and adaptive pause trimming.

2. MOTOR DE DIARIZAÇÃO E IDENTIFICAÇÃO DE LOCUTORES
   - Pyannote.audio 3.1 (MIT License / Hugging Face Community)
     Multi-speaker diarization and acoustic voice-print clustering.
   - SpeechBrain & PyTorch Lightning (Apache 2.0 License)
     Underlying neural pipelines for acoustic representation.

3. MOTOR DE TRADUÇÃO, CONTEXTO E DIREÇÃO DE CENA (LLM)
   - Qwen 3.5 / Qwen 2.5 (Alibaba Cloud - Apache 2.0 / Qwen Community License)
     Local LLM reasoning, dialogue context window, and Brazilian Portuguese adaptation.
   - Llama.cpp & llama-cpp-python (MIT License)
     High-performance local GGUF quantization inference on GPU (CUDA).

4. MOTOR DE SÍNTESE DE VOZ E CLONAGEM EMOCIONAL (TTS)
   - Qwen3-TTS / Chatterbox TTS (Apache 2.0 / MIT Licenses)
     Expressive voice generation and emotional audio synthesis.

5. MOTOR DE MÚSICA E TRILHA SONORA COM IA (VORTEX MUSIC / DJ)
   - ACE-Step 1.5 / YuE / ACE Studio (Apache 2.0 License)
     AI music synthesis, backing tracks, instrumental arrangements, and stems.
   - Demucs / OpenUnmix (MIT License)
     Stem separation for vocals, drums, bass, and instrumental backings.
   - SheetSage & mixingbear (MIT License)
     Harmonic transcription, chord estimation, and automated beatmatching.

6. PROCESSAMENTO, DECODIFICAÇÃO DE JOGOS E MASTERIZAÇÃO DE MÍDIA
   - FFmpeg (LGPL v2.1+ / GPL v2.0+)
     Hardware video encoding (NVENC), sidechain compression, audio ducking, and multiplexing.
   - vgmstream (ISC License)
     Game audio decoder supporting proprietary video game sound formats.
   - Pydub, SoundFile & Librosa (MIT / ISC Licenses)
     Audio editing, envelope manipulation, and waveform analytics.

7. INTERFACE DESKTOP E INFRAESTRUTURA DE SERVIDOR
   - Flask & Flask-CORS (BSD-3-Clause)
     Modular microservices and orchestrator API endpoints.
   - PyWebView (BSD-3-Clause)
     Native, lightweight desktop GUI shell engine.
   - PyTorch & Torchaudio (BSD-3-Clause)
     CUDA tensor computation and GPU resource scheduling.

